            <div xml:id="d707">

                <pb facs="0859" n="735" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg735"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.51/594: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cable</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-28T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>158. For General Crowder.</p>
                <p>Your 119, September 25, noon.</p>
                <p>Dwight Morrow, partner of J. P. Morgan &amp; Company, accompanied by Norman
                    Davis, will leave Washington for Havana on September 29, to confer with you and
                    later with the Cuban Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
